## Shared contact plan for crs-deletion test: Node 1 <-> Node 2 only.
## Node 1 additionally loads cgr-hint.ionrc which adds 2<->3 contacts so
## CGR on Node 1 can compute path 1->2->3. Node 2 must NOT have 2->3
## contacts, so its ipnfw immediately abandons with SrNoKnownRoute.

m horizon +0

a range +0 +600 1 2 1
a range +0 +600 2 1 1

a contact +0 +600 1 2 100000
a contact +0 +600 2 1 100000
